    "explanation" : "\nDon't omit the accumulator when calling `next` in a `reduce` block.\n\n# Examples\n\n```ruby\n\n# bad\nresult = (1..4).reduce(0) do |acc, i|\n  next if i.odd?\n  acc + i\nend\n\n# good\nresult = (1..4).reduce(0) do |acc, i|\n  next acc if i.odd?\n  acc + i\nend\n```\n\n[Source](http://www.rubydoc.info/gems/rubocop/RuboCop/Cop/Lint/NextWithoutAccumulator)",
